  "notes": "Chosen as Tadano's current 250 t 5-axle model (successor of AC 5.250-1; no AC 5.250-1 datasheet downloadable - tadano.com upload link now returns HTML). Datasheet has 14 boom lengths (13.4, 17.6, 21.8, 26.0, 30.2, 34.4, 38.6, 42.8, 47.0, 51.2, 55.4, 59.6, 63.8, 70.0 m); 12 stored. Omitted columns (t@radius m): 30.2 m: 94.8@3, 94.8@4, 94.8@5, 94.8@6, 94.8@7, 86.7@8, 78.1@9, 71.2@10, 64.7@11, 59.1@12, 49.6@14, 42.7@16, 38@18, 33.4@20, 29.2@22, 25.7@24, 23@26; 59.6 m: 22.2@6, 22.2@7, 22.2@8, 22.2@9, 22.2@10, 22.2@11, 22.2@12, 22.2@14, 22.2@16, 22.2@18, 20.9@20, 19.6@22, 18.3@24, 17@26, 15.9@28, 14.8@30, 13.8@32, 13@34, 12.2@36, 11.6@38, 10.9@40, 10@42, 9.5@44, 8.9@46, 8.1@48, 7.5@50, 6.9@52, 6.3@54, 5.9@56. 13,4* over-rear column (excluded): 250@2.5, 175.9@3, 151@4, 132.1@5, 116.9@6, 104@7, 90.2@8, 79.2@9, 67.4@10 (footnote 1 = over rear; 250.0 t** at 2.5 m is max capacity with additional special equipment). 2.5 m row dropped (empty in 360° columns). Values marked * in the chart require the heavy lift attachment (2 additional sheaves, 9 sheaves total, max 175.9 t): 13.4 m 175.9 @3, 151.0/150.3 @4 (over rear/360°), 129.5 @5 (360° column shows 129,5 unmarked; over rear 132.1*); 17.6 m 150.0 @3, 146.4 @4; 21.8 m 138.7 @3 and @4. Standard boom head has 7 sheaves for max 130.1 t. Across a row, longer booms sometimes show higher values than shorter ones (as printed). Counterweight 80 t = 49.6 t basic (7 pcs) + 4 additional pieces. Weight of hook blocks and slings is part of the load and must be deducted. Dimensions p.6 (mm): overall length 16340 (boom head to rear of superstructure); boom tip to carrier rear 15460 (+830 rear overhang of superstructure/counterweight); carrier 13930; boom overhang 1530; axle spacing 2560 (front to axle 1), 2700, 1650, 2440, 1700; rear overhang 2880; slewing centre 260 behind axle 4 (derived 9610 from carrier front). Outriggers longitudinal 9252 (5951 + 3301) / 9312 (5613 + 3699), transverse 8300 (2740/4130/5520/6910 intermediate). Width 3000 (385/95R25) / 3090 (525/80R25). Height 3940 (385/95R25) / 3990 (525/80R25); 3660/3710 also shown. Radii R5200, R5080, R4340 at superstructure rear (R5200 taken as tail radius with counterweight). Operating weight, max outrigger force, max hook height, boom pivot and number of boom sections not given numerically."
